blocks.explanation:
Jab safaid roshni compound par parti hai:
• agar poori jazb ho jaye to complex kaala nazar aata hai;
• agar saari roshni wapas aaye ya guzar jaye to safaid;
• agar kuch roshni jazb ho aur baqi wapas aaye to complex ka rang wapas aane wali roshni par munhasir hota hai.

d-d transition: complex mein d orbitals bat jate hain. Kam energy wale d orbital ka electron roshni jazb karke zyada energy wale d orbital mein chala jata hai (excite). Is ke liye zaroori energy Planck ki equation ΔE = hν = hc/λ ke mutabiq visible light ki khaas frequency aur wavelength ke barabar hoti hai.

Nazar aane wala rang: jazb na hone wali roshni guzar jati hai aur rang tay karti hai. Hum jo rang dekhte hain woh jazb shuda roshni ka complementary (ulta) rang hai, colour wheel (Figure 18.6) ke mutabiq. Maslan jo complex peeli roshni jazb kare woh violet nazar aata hai.
